      "message": "test: Capture USDT probes with GDB\n\nLaunch traced nodes as GDB children so the existing probe scenarios can\nrun without BCC, BPF privileges, or matching host kernel headers.\n\n- Copy probe arguments while stopped and drain complete records in the\n  test process, including events emitted during node shutdown and\n  restart.\n- Follow the bitcoin launcher through exec before registering probes.\n- Handle a GDB parser failure for GCC byte-register operands in usdt.py.\n- Disable LeakSanitizer only for traced children because it cannot\n  operate under ptrace; keep other sanitizer checks remain enabled.",
