        "payload": "tree c1160bf4f3566bf4336a16de2efee3eec0bec338\nparent 03d302c2c6aea1cee57025b6c37364292fac4d89\nauthor will <will@256k1.dev> 1792767088 +0100\ncommitter will <will@256k1.dev> 1792770660 +0100\n\nci: Run tracing tests without BPF dependencies\n\nThe USDT tests now launch nodes under GDB, so the ASan job no longer needs\nBCC, matching host kernel headers, or a privileged container. Install GDB\nand binutils and retain SYS_PTRACE for debugger and sanitizer operation.\nRemove the host-kernel package refresh and BCC workflow toggle along with\nthe dependencies they supported.\n",
